#### Resolving the WORDS audit

The subsequent source review resolved the exact Wiktionary noun sense of *negative* in favor of WORDS=+1. Its gloss identifies one word as the referent and specifies negation as that word's function. The NSM WORDS prime licenses singular word constructions, and NOT has a separate place in the chart. The revised typed contract distinguishes a word as the defining genus from a word mentioned under a different genus. [Source ruling](../../../../gse/docs/readings/2026-11-12-ssl-words-resolution/SOURCE_SCOPE.md)

